  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Infrastructure for Resilience (EU Facility for SuTP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to support Turkiye in improving access to education by Syrians under temporary protection (SuTP) and host communities through the expansion of disaster resilient education infrastructure in priority provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
